      "title": "Verify the seven live capstone paths",
      "instructions": "Use the SAME active administrator sandbox where you completed all five capstone steps. Configure the REAL /workspace/secure-project tree, not a separate qa-secure-project fixture. Verify the seven required files/directories, exact modes, and UID/GID ownership, including the root-owned README.md (0:0). Press Verify while this exact topic session remains active. The trusted Runner inspects the sandbox volume; browser command text or the independent code-input editor is not grading evidence. Do not modify host files, submit secrets, or leave this sandbox running after QA.",
      "expected": {
        "required": [
          {
            "path": "/workspace/secure-project",
            "kind": "directory",
            "mode": "0755",
            "uid": 1000,
            "gid": 1000
          },
          {
            "path": "/workspace/secure-project/README.md",
            "kind": "file",
            "mode": "0644",
            "uid": 0,
            "gid": 0
          },
          {
            "path": "/workspace/secure-project/scripts",
            "kind": "directory",
            "mode": "0700",
            "uid": 1000,
            "gid": 1000
          },
          {
            "path": "/workspace/secure-project/scripts/run.sh",
            "kind": "file",
            "mode": "0700",
            "uid": 1000,
            "gid": 1000
          },
          {
            "path": "/workspace/secure-project/secrets.env",
            "kind": "file",
            "mode": "0600",
            "uid": 1000,
            "gid": 1000
          },
          {
            "path": "/workspace/secure-project/shared",
            "kind": "directory",
